 ( { How should White recapture on f4? Choose between } 1. Rxf4 { and } 1. gxf4 { . } ) 
1. { -KEY- } gxf4 $1 { Correct! This powerful pawn capture may leave White with a fractured structure if Black plays ...fxe4, but stopping Black from having a strong central outpost on e5 is much more valuable. } ( 1. Rxf4 { still maintains an advantage, but it does have the problem of giving Black access to the e5 square. } Ne5 2. exf5 Bxf5 3. Qf1 $16 { White stands a little better due to the piece pressure, but Black remains in the game for now. } ) 
fxe4 2. Nxe4 Nf7 3. Qd4 $18 { White is already winning, due to their far better placed pieces and powerful attack against the Black king. } 
